Company Description

Inetum is a European leader in digital services. Inetum’s team of 28,000 consultants and specialists strive every day to make a digital impact for businesses, public sector entities and society. Inetum’s solutions aim at contributing to its clients’ performance and innovation as well as the common good.

Present in 19 countries with a dense network of sites, Inetum partners with major software publishers to meet the challenges of digital transformation with proximity and flexibility.

Driven by its ambition for growth and scale, Inetum generated sales of 2.5 billion euros in 2023.

Job Description

Service to ensure that all the applications are compliant with the company security standard: monitor and ease the security vulnerabilities remediation plans, patch management monitoring, obsolescence monitoring;
Service to Build action plan on vulnerabilities / monitor action and ease the resolution for developer;
Service to put in place appropriate scanning / monitoring of the applications to ensure they are compliant with the company standard, especially in term of IT security;
Service to drive regular compliance tests : Disaster recovery, pentests...;
Service to ensure regulatory compliance of the applications : DORA, data privacy, IFC...;
Service to drive the technical change, innovation (ex: GenIA, finops…), and evolution of the product;
Service to report on the global compliancy of the product (regulatory, security, operational…);
Service with active interfacing to define the developments best practices, ensure that they are applied and monitor (with KPIs).

Qualifications

Bachelor Degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field of expertise
Solid expertise on computer sciences including basic understanding of Cloud Computing, Database Models, Coding Languages, IA, architecture design and Cybersecurity;
Solid expertise of continuous integration (CI) and continuous delivery/deployment (CD) concepts and methodologies (ideally Azure Devops expertise);
Expertise in Data Science, Algorithms and Machine Learning applied to Risk Management in Insurance business (Nice to Have);
Service with solid expertise of software development lifecycles and Agile methodologies;
Azure fundamentals expertise;
Development Expertise: C#, Python;
Fluency in English is mandatory

